    <Major></Major>
    <Description>this script will help you to auto click refresh
commonly point blank server is full you can use this macro to refresh the server you wanna play
in indonesia much server being full then this macro will helpfully to refresh the server
you can bind this macro to your mouse or any key you want
</Description>
